C09 pi can belong to a minimum CURVE field of definition
j(y^2=x^3+A*x+B)= j
discriminant= 2985984*j**2/(j - 1728)**3
j=pi is nonsingular; any embedded field of definition contains j=pi.
This is a curve-level test. Minimal descent of the h1 motive up to isogeny is not proved by this calculation.

